Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.28,0:00:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a monster deep within your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.74,0:00:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking aim for your\Nheart so it would seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.46,0:00:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand tall and read, go to\Nhell and jump for paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.48,0:00:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time dangerous, dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.48,0:00:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We like it serious, serious, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.08,0:00:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking deep in the dream\Nthere is the one in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.66,0:00:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Turns out that's the one who\Nmeans the most to you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.06,0:00:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Adventure calls now, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.62,0:00:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The balls filled between\Nus, they will show.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.30,0:00:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Still what we don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.66,0:00:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, working hard together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.04,0:01:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.00,0:01:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Got to dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.54,0:01:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite the rivalry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.78,0:01:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta see it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.14,0:01:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We're living in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.52,0:01:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There's even charm in failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.14,0:01:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.48,0:01:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All the love and the tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.42,0:01:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,In the world we're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.10,0:01:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,United gently bringing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Our thought again, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.88,0:01:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the foolish ones\Nwe love. We'll carry on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.58,0:01:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Till we see the light, the sun will rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.28,0:01:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The greatest fight at its core.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.02,0:01:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Is against myself forevermore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.86,0:01:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's do it now, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.42,0:01:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The balls filled between\Nus, they will show.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.08,0:01:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So what we don't know, that's\Nwhat we call adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.02,0:01:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.86,0:01:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Got to dream despite the rivalry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.56,0:02:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta see it through believing in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.34,0:02:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There's even charm in failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.00,0:02:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.10,0:02:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.46,0:02:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.48,0:02:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.39,0:02:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.56,0:02:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.47,0:02:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we're the superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.44,0:02:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.12,0:02:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we're the superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.34,0:02:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Allies, get your asses in here\Ntill we come up with something!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.12,0:02:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.66,0:02:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We get to go in?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.48,0:02:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire tank pirates, provide cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.42,0:02:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Lili!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.96,0:02:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Veggie!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.06,0:03:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Veggie, I saw it with my own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.92,0:03:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You were plotting to\Nassassinate Mama, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.66,0:03:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How long has she been planning\Nthis from the beginning?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.36,0:03:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Get inside the castle, Lili!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.02,0:03:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, look! Cannon! Preparation!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.12,0:03:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Cannon firing, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.94,0:03:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Even cooler!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.02,0:03:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.18,0:03:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a robot. cancer!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.94,0:03:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time to be excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.06,0:03:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how long we\Ncan hold out like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.90,0:03:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, gee?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.52,0:04:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.66,0:04:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet it, the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.20,0:04:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Who dares to mess with the\Ngreat gangster, Castino?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.84,0:04:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.72,0:04:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Katakuri, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.48,0:04:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.54,0:04:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.68,0:04:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Governor, don't be slow, Leno.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.44,0:05:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll juice you to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.56,0:05:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.90,0:05:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.12,0:05:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna get past us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.00,0:05:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes! That's hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.56,0:05:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.47,0:05:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you now! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.39,0:05:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.80,0:05:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Gee!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.56,0:05:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.98,0:06:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Unite!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.89,0:06:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Gemma double six, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.96,0:06:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.66,0:07:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.90,0:07:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Burn like the trash you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.90,0:08:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I see why mama wanted their technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.52,0:08:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheap memory armor, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.08,0:08:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Lickety looks like it's\Nflame-proof, too. No matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.86,0:08:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use my candy to\Nimmobilize them once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.42,0:08:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.80,0:08:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,All who face our scientific\Nmight will kneel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.18,0:08:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You fleas are nothing to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.96,0:09:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you got in\Nthere, a bunch of hot air?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.44,0:09:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It sure as hell ain't muscle!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.52,0:09:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Aaaahhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.80,0:09:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.52,0:10:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you guys okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.04,0:10:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.74,0:10:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my pleasure. I assure you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.30,0:10:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're ready for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.04,0:10:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go, ship! Fire! Murphy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.72,0:10:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.26,0:10:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.02,0:10:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to pack it up, little-littles!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.96,0:10:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well, well!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.04,0:10:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's just\Nyou and me, Tomate Box,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.68,0:10:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,and thanks to all this chaos,\NI get a private showing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.60,0:10:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone else will be none the wiser.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.96,0:10:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take a little peek and see\Nwhat secrets you've got in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.60,0:11:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.46,0:11:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,She's still squawking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.96,0:11:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We got one more shot to\Nbump off the old Betty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.94,0:11:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It ain't over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.04,0:11:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Cannon firing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.52,0:11:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.64,0:11:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Candy wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.00,0:11:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Peril Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.42,0:11:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That one hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.12,0:12:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're colluding with Gemma, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.50,0:12:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Cuckoo, you deserve\Nwhatever is coming to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.08,0:12:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, laugh it up, bozo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.30,0:12:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, movement!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.34,0:12:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep blastin' it\Ntill I run out of ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.14,0:12:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mom! See you here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.76,0:12:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.90,0:12:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Firing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.66,0:12:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.82,0:12:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, fire it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.28,0:13:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,All the cannons on the left\Nwall have been destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.52,0:13:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like every last one of\Nthem is jammed with mochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.52,0:13:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If we fire, they'll blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.70,0:13:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I got an announcement, so make\Nsure you guys can hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.32,0:13:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The Big Father's treads\Nare trapped in candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.40,0:13:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Andy, that means we ain't going nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.02,0:13:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Even worse, we're surrounded on all\Nsides by Big Mom's whole family.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.12,0:13:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got no other choice but to hold\Nourselves up and wait for the inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.36,0:13:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We were so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.72,0:14:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If everyone steps out,\Nwe'll give them a licking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.12,0:14:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just delaying the endeavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.24,0:14:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you let them\Nuse your power like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.38,0:14:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the victim here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.92,0:14:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.42,0:14:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just kick their asses\Nand put this behind us, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.22,0:14:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Poison, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.34,0:14:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That might be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.76,0:14:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.28,0:14:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so jealous!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.56,0:14:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could turn into a giant castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.98,0:15:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Your devil food is so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.02,0:15:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wipe that grin off your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.76,0:15:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in a bad spot right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.40,0:15:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been planning that\Nassassination for a stinking year,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.46,0:15:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and the whole damn thing\Nblew up on our faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.70,0:15:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never failed at a hit job in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.02,0:15:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be losing my touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.10,0:15:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose an emperor may be\Nout of our league, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.08,0:15:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.28,0:15:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, we better do it quick,\Nbecause we won't be safe in here for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.04,0:15:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, get your heads\Non straight and listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.90,0:15:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This castle still meets.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.92,0:15:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's strong, but not unbreakable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.94,0:15:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If it gets busted up, then I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.44,0:15:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And that means nowhere for you to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.86,0:15:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, you're gonna be dinner for\Nall those sharks we got circling outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.32,0:15:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.38,0:16:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't get away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.00,0:16:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.52,0:16:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Her anger is bubbling up and boiling over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.20,0:16:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're damned if you leave, but\Nyou're damned if you stay in here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.66,0:16:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in dire straits.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.68,0:16:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't blame it on me, Benji.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.56,0:16:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That launcher was the world's\Nmost state-of-the-art.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.86,0:16:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened? You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.02,0:16:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Benji, you with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.08,0:16:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk to me, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.22,0:16:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.06,0:16:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.36,0:16:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.04,0:17:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You little rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.38,0:17:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop hiding!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.68,0:17:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Benji?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.12,0:17:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.54,0:17:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's creepy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.58,0:17:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,She's looking right at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.90,0:17:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.14,0:17:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So she came to her senses, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.20,0:17:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you come out of that\Ncastle. Stop cowering and face me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.60,0:17:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.52,0:17:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.62,0:17:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to pay the price\Nfor betraying me, Benji!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.54,0:17:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.00,0:17:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.91,0:17:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.04,0:18:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You ruined my tea party! You pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.72,0:18:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.32,0:18:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, the pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.32,0:18:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Think you can't run?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.12,0:18:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.20,0:18:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's me, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.20,0:18:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Beggy's my husband, and we have\Na child together, you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.94,0:18:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.76,0:18:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Siobhan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.72,0:18:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You dare to beg me with Lola's face?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.24,0:18:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,She's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.26,0:18:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Race yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.64,0:18:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back, Chiffon! Get down! Please! Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.10,0:18:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Your ugly mug is the last\Nthing I want to see right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.04,0:18:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.02,0:18:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.40,0:18:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,OK!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.31,0:19:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you in on this assassination\Nplot, Chiffon? Traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.48,0:19:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't live to eat\Nanother bite of sweets!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.26,0:19:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.10,0:19:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll destroy the castle in Veggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.44,0:19:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,When he dies, all the others\Nwill be thrown out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.74,0:19:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let a single one of them escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.00,0:19:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's the fire tank pirates, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.00,0:19:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And some of the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.68,0:19:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,They've got Jinbe as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.32,0:19:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And Germa Double Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.18,0:19:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,All of them are responsible\Nfor ruining the tea party.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.76,0:19:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They thought they could\Nget away with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.94,0:19:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.04,0:19:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's teach them all a lesson\Nfor the whole world to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.90,0:19:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.84,0:19:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Benji! Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.76,0:19:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.92,0:19:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.46,0:19:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, that stinkin' hag.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.62,0:19:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I could take cannon\Nfire without a scratch,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.40,0:20:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,but she's banging up the big fodder\Nlike my arm is made of cardboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.44,0:20:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go out there and kick her ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.38,0:20:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no other way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.29,0:20:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.82,0:20:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, go stop him! I'm on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.24,0:20:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.56,0:20:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.38,0:20:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, I gotta go fight! Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.30,0:20:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to risk your life for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.88,0:20:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We came here to take back Sanji,\Nand that is exactly what we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.12,0:20:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only that, we got a copy of the\NPoneglyph and rescued Sanji's family.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.74,0:20:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,just like he asked us to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.26,0:20:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't throw away everything\Nwe've accomplished so far!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.56,0:20:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If you have enough time to fight back,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.76,0:20:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,then why don't you think about\Nhow we can escape instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.46,0:20:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If we'd come here to fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.00,0:20:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,then we would have brought Zoro and\NFranky and everyone else, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.48,0:20:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, it's just as Nami says.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.10,0:20:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We were fortunate to have made it this\Nfar, and we owe that to our small numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.76,0:20:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The others are waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.14,0:20:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We must make it to the\Nland of Wano safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.20,0:21:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Page!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.06,0:21:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not good. Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.00,0:21:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.64,0:21:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, we can't just leave him like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.88,0:21:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Benji's going through all this pain\Nbecause he's trying to protect us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.24,0:21:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.62,0:21:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,My plan is in shambles over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.06,0:21:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to stand by and listen\Nto you brag about all your success.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.74,0:21:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean you're\Ngoing to throw us out?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.54,0:21:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to take us down with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.84,0:21:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I did my job just like you told me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.62,0:21:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me back my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.12,0:21:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Take you down, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.12,0:21:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't a bad idea. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.40,0:21:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Not like I have any particular\Nfondness for you mugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.16,0:22:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Thing is, we're in this together,\Nand I care about my men so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.58,0:22:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I love my wife and child so much;
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.94,0:22:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no way in hell\NI'm letting them die here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.84,0:22:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.16,0:22:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.50,0:22:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Benji!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.82,0:22:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If we want everyone in here to survive,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.54,0:22:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,there's only one answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.64,0:22:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.84,0:22:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.92,0:22:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't get out there,\Nthen I'm gonna destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.36,0:22:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,it's only a matter of time now,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.58,0:22:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,get ready to bust them up the\Nsecond they come out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.92,0:23:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,i can't escape now—show no\Nmercy, kill every last one!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.06,0:23:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,don't
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.56,0:23:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,keep a lady waiting because i think\Ni'm due for some sweet revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.30,0:23:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.84,0:23:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,so here's how it goes: the big fodder\Nlooks like a castle but it's still me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.78,0:23:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,so this room is actually inside my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.48,0:23:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.92,0:23:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,don't freak out on me kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.78,0:23:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.32,0:23:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,matter how much I get roughed up outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.26,0:23:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Even
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.02,0:23:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,if the big fodder gets\Nknocked over flat on its back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.08,0:23:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.38,0:23:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,rest of you won't get hurt\Nor even shaken around.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.94,0:23:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,In
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.10,0:23:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,other words, as long as I don't bite\Nthe big one, you guys are safe in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.28,0:23:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I hadn't noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.28,0:23:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Only Veggie has been\Naffected by the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.26,0:23:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.20,0:23:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,can hear Big Mom pounding\Nher fists against the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.36,0:23:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.72,0:24:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,it's perfectly calm in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.54,0:24:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You're
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.56,0:24:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,starting to get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.00,0:24:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And even if I change back into my human\Nform, the inside is still unaffected.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.72,0:24:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, I'll change back from my\Ncastle form, keeping all I is inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.64,0:24:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Caesar will carry me\Nand fly away to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.02,0:24:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.12,0:24:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,we can make it to the shore,\Nwe'll blow this popsicle!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.08,0:24:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,popsicle
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.96,0:24:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.87,0:24:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do I have to risk my life out\Nthere while everybody else stays safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.02,0:24:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And this plan is a suicide\Nmission, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.36,0:24:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get riddled with bullets the\Nsecond those maniacs lay eyes on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.54,0:24:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This plan has a less than\N0 % chance of success.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.26,0:24:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Even turning into gas won't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.94,0:24:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll just use their stinking\Narmament Haki to take me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.08,0:24:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.04,0:24:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.76,0:24:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you save us?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.62,0:25:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We fell into that trap on our own,\Nand we are hardly your allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.04,0:25:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Because my father would be\Ndisappointed in me, that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.44,0:25:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I used to hold on to all the\Nresentment from so many years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.06,0:25:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did I do wrong, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.72,0:25:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.28,0:25:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.98,0:25:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry that I was supposed to leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.88,0:25:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.32,0:25:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't live in here by myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.76,0:25:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'd grown up to be such\Na small-minded man that
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.14,0:25:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I would laugh at the death\Nof my own flesh and blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.84,0:25:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't face him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.46,0:25:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.40,0:25:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't catch cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.62,0:25:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't stand tall and look my\Nfather in the eye, then I've failed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.30,0:26:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, if anyone\Never asks about your family,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.16,0:26:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,you must never tell\Nthem who your father is.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.76,0:26:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Having you as a son is my greatest shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.00,0:26:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You must know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.72,0:26:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirteen years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.56,0:26:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Vinsmoke Sanji escaped from the\NKingdom of Germa and died at sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.54,0:26:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You got exactly what you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.24,0:26:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,After this, we're done!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.00,0:26:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not my father, Finn, Smoke,\NJudge, and don't you forget that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.30,0:26:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,After this, I don't ever\Nwant to see your face again!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.18,0:27:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.42,0:27:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You have my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.46,0:27:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the last you'll see of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.68,0:27:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll stay away from\Nthe East Blue as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.12,0:27:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you stop relying on me for help?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.78,0:27:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I fulfilled my part of the bargain!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.22,0:27:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't help us, then\Nyou die too! Jesus! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.28,0:27:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the castle gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.60,0:27:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear my words, Peggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.64,0:27:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Until Caesar delivers\Nyou safely from here,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.78,0:27:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Germa double six will act as your guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.66,0:27:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.70,0:28:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't get to volunteer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.16,0:28:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't agree to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.30,0:28:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You're acting all noble, but\Nyou're as arrogant as ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.54,0:28:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.88,0:28:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You Germa people can fly too, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.52,0:28:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So we can leave without yous? Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.80,0:28:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.71,0:28:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're buying time, then I'll help too!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.84,0:28:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's alright, Luffy. You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.70,0:28:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be indebted\Nto that failure any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.24,0:28:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This is his way of making amends.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.26,0:28:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't get ahead of yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.74,0:29:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I still haven't agreed to this, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.84,0:29:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop whining.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.78,0:29:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.10,0:29:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't pay for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.54,0:29:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't hide from me, Bimsy!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.96,0:29:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Jennifer, don't hold anything back!
